-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations               78   ->   13          
Number of variables                   4   ->   13          
j variable (6 values)              case   ->   (dropped)
xij variables:
                               expected   ->   expected1 expected2 ... expected6
                                case_ok   ->   case_ok1 case_ok2 ... case_ok6
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

