> aner" "FHK between: value added shifts among staying firms" "FHK cross: both at the same firm" "FHK entry: firms that 
> appear" "FHK exit: firms that disappear" "MP staying firms: plain average" "MP staying firms: shift of value added" "M
> P entry: firms that appear" "MP exit: firms that disappear""'

